    "number": 118,
    "title": "docs: synchronize Nanoleaf integration settings delivery",
    "body": "Refs jimmie-potts/codex-nanoleaf#49 and its merged PR #63.\n\nRecord the delivered Nanoleaf-owned settings/assignment extension, source CI and closed acceptance in the shared guide. Refresh paginated history and backlog inputs, remove closed #49 from primary coverage and roadmap, and retain it as a completed reference. The same refresh observed Pixoo #32 closed; its saved receipt supplies the completed renderer row. Its owning companion remains PR #117.\n\nShared controller v1 and the mode-only MCP interface remain unchanged. Existing diagram topology and dated source-review pins still describe the controller, private state and sole writer. The merged API guide documents the new versioned operations. Frontend integration, installation and physical acceptance remain separate. This PR does not publish the public guide.\n\nValidation at `777840580f120b1f85ae6dc1a229bc5b4f5cd258`: generation, five maintenance tests, six viewport checks at 1440/1000/900/768/390/320, print expansion/restoration, links/interactions and committed-output regeneration passed. 100 open issues have exactly one primary guide; 12 guides, nine diagrams and 49 roadmap nodes. HTML SHA-256 `82c810e3f1223cd5ec0fcb26a11543e12f6bc8e00b2c24af560d1f0bf1668672`. Browser receipt/screenshots retained locally. The initial refreshed coverage failed because #49 and concurrent Pixoo #32 had closed; primary and roadmap coverage were reconciled before these passing checks.\n\nGuide-only CI receipt: fixed comparison base `58a9a3dee78107c13eb1896e1fcd3b540c07b75a` to head `777840580f120b1f85ae6dc1a229bc5b4f5cd258`. All 15 paths are modifications under docs/work-guide, with no renames/deletions. Both unchanged workflows ci.yml and work-guide.yml filter pull_request and main push with paths-ignore docs/work-guide/**. Current-head API reads show zero runs/checks and authoritative merge state clean. Protection/ruleset API inspection is unavailable under the account plan; no protection bypass is requested. Final independent Standards/Specification review and guarded merge remain pending.\n\nComplete candidate path comparison:\n```\nM\tdocs/work-guide/outputs/agent-device-work-guides.html\nM\tdocs/work-guide/updates.md\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/agent-device-hub-prs.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/codex-nanoleaf-digest.txt\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/codex-nanoleaf-issues.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/device-native-deps.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/divoom-app-upgrade-digest.txt\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/divoom-app-upgrade-issues.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/guide-coverage.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/hub-native-deps.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/backlogs/snapshot.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/build_guide.py\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/history/github-history.json\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/refresh_backlogs.py\nM\tdocs/work-guide/work/timeline.py\n```\n\nExecution: coordinator owns edits and publication; two fresh independent guide reviewers requested Terra/high. Actual execution model/reasoning and usage are unexposed. No advisory consultations. Public publication and live website verification remain outside this source task.\n",
